"Reclaims only completed, idle backing. Pool capacities and reusable objects are retained." = "只回收 GPU 已完成且閒置的底層內存，保留池容量和可復用對象。";
"Drops the compilation-only object after prewarm while retaining all active pipelines." = "預熱後釋放僅用於編譯的對象，保留全部活動管線。";
"Combines compatible clears; uncertain cases keep separate operations." = "合併兼容的清除操作；不確定的情況仍分別執行。";
"Avoids materializing an intermediate native texture when the complete copy is equivalent." = "完整複製等價時，省去中間原生紋理的實體化。";
"Reduces rounding waste in new GPU-only blocks without reducing retained byte budgets." = "減少新建 GPU 暫存塊的取整浪費，不縮小保留字節預算。";
"Combines texture reading and PS4 tiling for supported formats; others retain the original path." = "對支持的格式合併紋理讀取與 PS4 平鋪；其他格式保留原實現。";
"Narrows declarations only for resources whose bindings are known; unknown cases remain conservative." = "僅縮小綁定已知資源的聲明範圍；未知情況仍採用保守覆蓋。";
"Avoids redundant dependency boundaries while retaining required synchronization." = "省去冗余依賴邊界，保留必要的同步。";
"Reduces compatible compute encoder transitions while retaining query ordering." = "減少兼容計算編碼器之間的切換，保留查詢順序。";
"Applies only to verified direct bindings; pointer-based and unknown workloads retain full coverage." = "僅適用於確認過的直接綁定；指針訪問與未知任務仍保留完整覆蓋。";
"Uses the same nearest resolve and tiling result, avoiding an intermediate full-size copy." = "保持原有最近鄰還原與平鋪結果，省去中間全尺寸副本。";
"Adopted by choice despite noisy isolated FPS; the safe full-surface fallback remains." = "儘管單項幀率波動較大，仍按你的選擇採用；保留安全的完整表面回退。";
"Correctness tested, but repeatable gameplay benefit is unconfirmed; may increase compilation or resource overhead." = "影格率收益未確認，可能增加編譯或資源開銷。";
"Removes tiny buffer copies, but adds compute transitions. No repeatable FPS gain; memory was about 37 MiB higher in one comparison." = "影格率收益未確認；一次對照中多用約 37 MiB 記憶體。";
"V2 float profile: benefit is unconfirmed and floating-point results may change. Switching rebuilds the shader cache." = "可能改變浮點結果，收益未確認；切換後需重建著色器。";
"Earlier archive loading used about 0.6 GiB more process memory. Default off; turning off ignores existing archive files without deleting them." = "先前載入時多用約 0.6 GiB 記憶體；關閉後忽略封存檔，保留檔案。";
