"Preserves every write. No FPS gain in the M4 comparison; takes priority over compute and in-pass updates for repeated-byte values." = "保留每次寫入。M4 對照無幀率收益；重複位元組值優先走此路徑，而非運算或通道內寫入。";
"Memoize conservative residency bookkeeping" = "重用完整範圍的駐留記錄";
"Keeps full resource ranges and invalidates on demotion. Correctness checks passed; the earlier M4 comparison was 3.3% slower." = "保留完整資源範圍，降級時失效。正確性檢查通過；先前 M4 對照慢約 3.3%。";
"Merge identical physical copy stores" = "合併相同實體位址的複製寫入";
"Skips the second store only when both resolved pointers match. Correctness checks passed; the earlier M4 comparison was 1% slower." = "僅在兩個解析指標相同時省去第二次寫入。正確性檢查通過；先前 M4 對照慢約 1%。";
"Write small parameters within the render pass" = "在繪製通道內寫入小參數";
"Retains all writes and barriers; unknown fragment conflicts fall back. The earlier M4 comparison was 8.6% slower; adds a small host pipeline." = "保留全部寫入和屏障，未知片元衝突走原路徑。先前 M4 對照慢約 8.6%；增加一個小型主機管線。";

"Preserve heap release history" = "保留堆釋放記錄";
"Prioritizes heap release records within the existing capacity. M4 tests found no confirmed performance or net memory benefit." = "優先保留堆釋放記錄，容量不變；M4 測試未確認效能或淨記憶體收益。";

"Continue passes across depth/stencil layout changes" = "延續深度／模板佈局切換通道";
"Only merges compatible read-only-to-write transitions. Keeps feedback, query and synchronization guards. Performance benefit is unconfirmed." = "僅合併相容的唯讀轉寫入通道；保留回饋、遮擋和同步檢查，實測效益尚未確認。";

"ARM64 renderer host" = "ARM64 算繪宿主";
"Runs the renderer in a native process; the game still uses Rosetta. About 6% faster in the matched M4 test." = "算繪器在原生程序中執行，遊戲仍使用 Rosetta。M4 同場景對照約提升 6%。";

"Reuse identical Metal libraries" = "重用相同著色器程式庫";
"Avoids duplicate compilation; practical benefit is unconfirmed." = "減少重複編譯，實際收益待確認。";

// Runtime capabilities
"This runtime requires a native ARM64 Metal renderer host." = "此執行環境需要原生 ARM64 Metal 算繪宿主。";
"Metal libraries are prepared automatically on this Mac before play." = "啟動遊戲前，自動在這台 Mac 上準備 Metal 程式庫。";

"This ARM64 runtime currently supports Metal only." = "此 ARM64 執行環境目前僅支援 Metal。";

"Reuse recent DeviceLocal staging blocks" = "重用最近的 DeviceLocal 暫存區塊";
"Tries recently used DeviceLocal staging blocks first. Capacity and completion fences are unchanged; performance benefit is unconfirmed." = "優先嘗試最近使用的 DeviceLocal 暫存區塊。容量和完成柵欄保持不變，效能收益尚未確認。";

"The ARM64 runtime is incomplete or has the wrong architecture." = "ARM64 執行環境不完整或元件架構不符。";

